  "description": "The VTUVIA GEMINI is a high-performance all-terrain e-bike built for power, endurance, and adventure. Featuring a 1000W brushless motor with a peak output of 1500W and 100Nm of torque, this powerhouse delivers exceptional acceleration and climbing ability, conquering steep hills and rugged trails with ease.\nEquipped with dual 52V 21Ah LG-certified batteries, the GEMINI boasts a remarkable range of up to 90 miles on a single charge, offering unmatched endurance for long-distance rides or all-day expeditions. The long-lasting, reliable battery system ensures you're always ready for the next challenge.\nDesigned for all-terrain performance, the GEMINI features a durable aluminum frame, 26\" x 4\" fat tires for superior traction on sand, snow, mud, or gravel, and a hydraulic front suspension fork that absorbs shocks for a smooth and comfortable ride.\nThe advanced hydraulic disc brakes provide reliable and precise stopping power in all weather conditions, while the intuitive LCD keeps you informed with real-time ride data, including speed, battery life, and assist levels.\nWhether you're seeking thrilling off-road adventures, tackling steep inclines, or cruising through the city, the VTUVIA GEMINI delivers exceptional performance and versatility, ensuring every ride is an exhilarating experience.",
